<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
    <title>Einloggen | Harvest Hollow</title>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="auth-shell">
        <a class="back-link" href="/">&lt;- Zurueck zur Farm</a>
        <section class="auth-layout">
            <div class="auth-intro">
                <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> Schoen, dich zu sehen</p>
                <h1>Zurueck auf<br><em>deiner Farm.</em></h1>
                <p>Logge dich ein und setze dein Abenteuer dort fort, wo du es verlassen hast.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="form-panel">
                <div class="form-heading"><span class="panel-icon">HH</span><div><p class="form-kicker">Harvest Hollow</p><h2>Einloggen</h2></div></div>
                <form action="/login" method="post">
                    <label for="username">Benutzername</label>
                    <input type="text" id="username" name="username" placeholder="z. B. farmfreund" autocomplete="username" required>
                    <label for="password">Passwort</label>
                    <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="Dein Passwort" autocomplete="current-password" required>
                    <button class="button form-button" type="submit">Einloggen <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></button>
                </form>
                <p class="form-footer">Noch kein Konto? <a href="/register">Jetzt registrieren</a></p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>